  "html": "<!-- TODO (EJ): a gameplay GIF would be even better when you can grab one. -->\n<p class=\"\">This was my first experiment in coding a PICO-8 game, so I wanted it to tie into something that sparks joy for me — motorcycle rides — and try to capture its essence in a minimalist video game sketch. That's the exact transmutation that I think makes PICO-8 magical. I hand-coded the whole thing, referencing the docs — this was pre-robot, June 2023. My brother made the sprites and the music (a tracker engine that escalates through five patterns as speed climbs, then collapses on a crash).</p>\n<p class=\"\">I love how it feels once you get to a high speed and the road is coming at you fast — it does, in fact, remind me of the feeling of riding a motorcycle. Which I think is, like, an artistic achievement of some kind.</p>\n<figure role=\"figure\" aria-label=\"The motorcycle.p8 source in the Pico-8 editor — perlin road sway and the speed-driven music-pattern engine\" class=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/motorcycle-pico8/source.png\" alt=\"The motorcycle.p8 source in the Pico-8 editor — perlin road sway and the speed-driven music-pattern engine\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_640/projects/motorcycle-pico8/source.png 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_960/projects/motorcycle-pico8/source.png 960w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/motorcycle-pico8/source.png 1280w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1920/projects/motorcycle-pico8/source.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 430px) 92vw, (max-width: 768px) 85vw, 900px\" title=\"The motorcycle.p8 source in the Pico-8 editor — perlin road sway and the speed-driven music-pattern engine\" width=\"1152\" height=\"636\" style=\"--splay-rot:-0.6deg;\" data-dimensions=\"1152×636\" class=\"img-full my-8 rounded-sm img-splay aspect-video w-full mx-auto py-4\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n<figcaption class=\"\">The motorcycle.p8 source in the Pico-8 editor — perlin road sway and the speed-driven music-pattern engine</figcaption>\n</figure>",
